          "author": "Tender Tales",
          "description": "Two siblings watch with concern as something goes wrong with an excavator at an ice cream shop construction site. Friends hold their breath when a skid steer gets stuck during a playground renovation. A girl watches in awe as her new school is built—until a dump truck runs into trouble. This collection of interactive short stories, trivia, and a fun song is perfect for kids who love construction and big machines. From concrete mixers to cranes, these stories bring busy building sites to life. They also help children build resilience, patience, and empathy as they observe the world around them. \n\nTender Tales are inclusive stories that value all children and families 🏳️‍🌈.",
